# easyeda2kicad (and the KiCad symbol editor) rewrite a .bak copy of the whole
# library on every single run. They are local, auto-regenerated backups -- but
# tracked they double repo growth and conflict on every cross-machine merge.
# The files stay on disk, git just stops following them.
/easyeda2kicad/easyeda2kicad.bak
/personal_lib/kicad_personal_library.bak
